!ESUG 2026 International Conference

The 31th ESUG conference will be held in Plovdiv, Bulgaria from Tuesday 7th to Friday 10th of July 2026. The collocated *isLoop summer school>https://isloop.pharo.org/* to be held from Saturday 4th to Monday 6th of July 2026 and spread all during the conference through *student volunteering program>callForStudents.html*.

!! Program & Info
- *Conference Venue and trip information>venue.html*
- *Calls for Contributions>callForContributions.html*
- *Conference Registration (opening soon)>http://registration.esug.org*. 
Now you can also pay (without extra fees) at *HelloAsso>https://www.helloasso.com/associations/esug/evenements/esug-2025*.

Early registration deadline: 15/04/2025

Registration fees are to be defined. Conference prices ESUG 2025 in Euros:

- Early Registration Fee: 600€ (all days) / 200€ (per day)
- Late Registration Fee: 1000€ (all days) / 300€ (per day)
- Extra person to social dinner: 70€
- Payment by bank transfer: free of charge
- Payment by credit card: \+6\% fees
- For late registrations we cannot ensure the availability of T-Shirts nor Social Event extra participants
*Cancellation Policy*: If the refund is requested during the early bird period all the fee (without charges) will be refunded. If it is requested after the early bird period is finished, the refund will be 50%



